<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1521', padding: '60px' }}>
  <Box style={{ marginBottom: 26 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>安装两个软件</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 64, height: 3, background: '#63A7D4', marginTop: 14 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 480, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 300, background: '#3A5CBC', borderRadius: 16, padding: 32, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
      <FAIcon name='download' style={{ fill: '#FFFFFF', width: 56, height: 56 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>只需要<br />装两个</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E3F1F8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        一个管同步（Git）<br />一个写代码（编辑器）<br />都是一路点下一步
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#13263B', borderRadius: 14, padding: 20, gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 10, background: '#24428F', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>安装 Git</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          打开 <span style={{ color: '#63A7D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>git-scm.com/download/win</span> 下载，一路点「Next」。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          装完在桌面<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>右键</span>，能看到 <span style={{ color: '#5DCAA5', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Git Bash Here</span> 就成功了。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#13263B', borderRadius: 14, padding: 20, gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 46, height: 46, borderRadius: 10, background: '#24428F', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>安装 VS Code</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          打开 <span style={{ color: '#63A7D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>code.visualstudio.com</span> 下载，一路下一步。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          以后用它来写代码、改文件，比记事本好用得多。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '14px 20px', background: '#232C37', borderRadius: 10 }}>
        <FAIcon name='info-circle' style={{ fill: '#4DA3FF', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#A9CFE7', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不会装就截图发群里，大家对着图一起看，别自己卡半天。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
